sequenceDiagram
    participant P as Pipeline (subagent-dev)
    participant CB as react-component-builder
    participant IE as react-infrastructure-engineer
    participant AI as react-api-integrator
    participant BE as react-backend-engineer
    participant SR as react-spec-reviewer
    participant CR as react-code-reviewer

    Note over P: Route task to specialized agent
    alt Component / Page / Styling task
        P->>CB: Dispatch task + spec
        CB->>CB: Read design system + react-bits
        CB->>CB: Write test (TDD)
        CB->>CB: Implement component + styles
        CB->>CB: Verify tests pass + commit
        CB-->>P: Report (files, tests, commit)
    else Infrastructure / Routing / State task
        P->>IE: Dispatch task + spec
        IE->>IE: Read patterns (router, zustand, types)
        IE->>IE: Write test (TDD)
        IE->>IE: Implement config/store/types
        IE->>IE: Verify tests pass + commit
        IE-->>P: Report (files, tests, commit)
    else API Integration / Data Fetching task
        P->>AI: Dispatch task + spec
        AI->>AI: Read TanStack Query patterns
        AI->>AI: Write test (TDD)
        AI->>AI: Implement hooks + client
        AI->>AI: Verify tests pass + commit
        AI-->>P: Report (files, tests, commit)
    else Backend / API task
        P->>BE: Dispatch task + spec
        BE->>BE: Read backend patterns
        BE->>BE: Write test (TDD)
        BE->>BE: Implement endpoint/schema
        BE->>BE: Verify tests pass + commit
        BE-->>P: Report (files, tests, commit)
    end

    P->>SR: Review spec compliance
    SR-->>P: PASS or FAIL (with gaps)

    alt FAIL
        P->>P: Return to same agent for fixes
    end

    P->>CR: Review code quality
    CR-->>P: PASS / COMMENT / CHANGE_REQUIRED

    alt CHANGE_REQUIRED
        P->>P: Return to same agent for fixes
    end

    Note over P: All tasks complete → Trigger finish-branch
